    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Park It!</strong> is a grid-based puzzle game where players park cars in designated spots across 78 levels. Designed for all skill levels, each level challenges your thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>78 Engaging Levels: Navigate increasingly intricate parking scenarios that require careful planning and accurate movements.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAR-INSPIRED MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the direction of the vehicle before parking. Optimise your moves with side turns. This highlights the engaging puzzle aspect that encourages players to think about the parking challenge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.poster.avif?t=1753714829\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.webm?t=1753714829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.mp4?t=1753714829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you park perfectly without running out of gas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Park It!</strong> is a grid-based puzzle game where players park cars in designated spots across 78 levels. Designed for all skill levels, each level challenges your thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>78 Engaging Levels: Navigate increasingly intricate parking scenarios that require careful planning and accurate movements.<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAR-INSPIRED MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the direction of the vehicle before parking. Optimise your moves with side turns. This highlights the engaging puzzle aspect that encourages players to think about the parking challenge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.poster.avif?t=1753714829\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.webm?t=1753714829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2989830/extras/b9208a2512c537fe5179b0670e096ef5.mp4?t=1753714829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you park perfectly without running out of gas?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
